        "source_sha256": "0ae90c81d685b93e13d54424d60c8f427ad3f15d0ee7c181887827bacafeeeb5",
        "text": "top of page\nLog In\n# Brighter Days for Alum Rock\nI'm running for school board because I believe students and families at Alum Rock deserve better. I've been a life-long advocate for public education and will make sure that Alum Rock is represented at the state level as your Trustee for Area 5.\n## Meet Jenny Ludwig\nA lifelong teacher dedicated to public education, Jenny is committed to advocating for students, families, and staff across Alum Rock.\nRead My Story\n### Strengthening Academic and Social Support\nI am focused on strengthening the core academic program of Alum Rock by investing in our schools and teachers to ensure every child has the opportunity to succeed.\n## My Priorities\nI am focused on the issues that matter most to our community: student academic growth and the conditions for a safe and welcoming Alum Rock.\n### Welcoming Schools for All Students\nI value the strengths of all students at Alum Rock and will ensure that all schools value the principles of cultural diversity, equity, equality and inclusion.\n### Advocating for Alum Rock Students\nWith my experience advocating for increased school funding for public schools throughout California, I know what it takes to bring partners together for quality schools.\n## Your Voice, Our Future\nA better Alum Rock requires action from all of us. Whether you can donate your time or your resources, every contribution makes a difference.\nVolunteer Today\nbottom of page",
        "text_limited": false,
        "title": "Vote Jenny Ludwig for Alum Rock",
