        "text": "top of page\nLog In\n# Endorsements\nI am proud to be endorsed by a wide range of community members that want to see Alum Rock thrive. Here are just a few of them!\nAlum Rock Educators Association (AREA)\nSylvia Arenas\nCounty Supervisor\nAva Chiao\nBoard Member, Cupertino Union School District\nPattie Cortese\nEast Side Union High School District Board Member\nBryan Do\nEast Side Union High School District Board Member\nMarissa Hanson\nFormer East Side Teacher Association President\nFormer Board Member, Evergreen School District\nVeronica Talton\nMusic Teacher, Alum Rock Union School District\nBrian Wheatley\nVice President of San Jose Unified School District Board\nMary Jo Zientek\nFormer Director of the Consumer and Environmental Protection Agency (CEPA) of the County of Santa Clara\nDemocrats for Public Education\nSouth Bay Labor Council\nSanta Clara Democrats\nRudy J Rodriguez\nBoard Member, Franklin-McKinley School District\nBAYMEC\nBay Area Municipal Elections Committee\nVince Tran\nPTA Treasurer, Painter School\nBetty Duong\nCounty Supervisor,\nCounty of Santa Clara\nTanya Freudenberger\nFormer Alum Rock Union School Board Member\nChrystine Villareal\nCommunity Leader\nIBEW\nInternational Brotherhood of Electrical Workers (IBEW) Local Union 332\nbottom of page",
